NAME
       mv - move or rename files

SYNOPSIS
       mv [OPTION]... SOURCE DEST
       mv [OPTION]... SOURCE... DIRECTORY

DESCRIPTION
       Rename SOURCE to DEST, or move SOURCEs into DIRECTORY. When a plain
       rename is not possible the data is copied and the source removed.

OPTIONS
       -n
           do not overwrite an existing file

       -i
           prompt before overwrite

       -f
           do not prompt before overwriting

       -v
           explain what is being done

       -t DIR
           move all SOURCE arguments into DIR

EXAMPLES
       mv old.txt new.txt
       mv *.c src/

SEE ALSO
       cp(1), rm(1)
